                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "FCWWn",
                          "name": "Embedded SOP Document Preview",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fill_container",
                          "fill": "$bg-subtle",
                          "cornerRadius": 10,
                          "stroke": "$border-strong",
                          "strokeWidth": 1,
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "padding": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ihWBR",
                              "name": "Doc Header",
                              "fill": "$text-brand",
                              "content": "PRATINJAU DOKUMEN: SOP-TPM-01 (AUTONOMOUS MAINTENANCE UNIT 2)",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                              "fontSize": 11,
                              "fontWeight": "700"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "fxdv9",
                              "name": "Step",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "1. Pastikan status Mesin Packing #6 pada HMI-T7 berada pada mode Planned Sanitasi (Register D000=2, D001=3).",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                              "fontSize": 12,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "sC7a1",
                              "name": "Step",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "2. Bersihkan sisa kristal garam pada corong hopper, auger filler, dan rel konveyor menggunakan udara kering bertekanan (dilarang menyiram air langsung ke area sensor SEN-S01).",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                              "fontSize": 12,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "MZTsF",
                              "name": "Step",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "3. Periksa permukaan elemen Vertical Heater Sealer (SEN-T01); bersihkan kerak plastik PE agar suhu kerja stabil di 165 C +- 5 C.",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                              "fontSize": 12,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Q5d76",
                              "name": "Step",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "4. Catat penyelesaian sanitasi (target <= 35 menit) pada layar HMI-T7 sebelum memulai siklus produksi berikutnya.",
